# AWE Presentation OS — Environment Variables Example

## API Gateway

```env
API_PORT=3000
API_HOST=0.0.0.0

# API Keys for testing/development
API_KEY_DEMO=demo-key-123
API_KEY_TEST=test-key-456

# Rate limiting (requests per minute)
RATE_LIMIT_FREE=10
RATE_LIMIT_PRO=100
RATE_LIMIT_ENTERPRISE=1000
```

## Production Deployment

```env
NODE_ENV=production
API_PORT=8080
API_HOST=127.0.0.1

# Database connection (for user management)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/awe

# Redis (for rate limiting and caching)
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# Stripe (for payments)
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_...
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...
```
